      <encodingDesc>
         <projectDesc>
            <p xml:lang="en"><ref target="https://www.clarin.eu/pressmint">PressMint</ref> is a project that aims to (1) create a multilingual set of corpora of historical newspapers uniformly encoded according to the <ref target="https://clarin-eric.github.io/PressMint/">PressMint encoding guidelines</ref>; (2) add linguistic annotations to the corpora; and (3) make the corpora available through concordancers.</p>
            <p xml:lang="de"><ref target="https://www.clarin.eu/pressmint">PressMint</ref> ist ein Projekt, das darauf abzielt, (1) eine mehrsprachige Sammlung von Korpora historischer Zeitungen zu erstellen, die einheitlich gemäß den <ref target="https://clarin-eric.github.io/PressMint/">PressMint-Encoding-Richtlinien</ref> kodiert sind; (2) die Korpora mit linguistischen Annotationen zu versehen; und (3) die Korpora über Konkordanzwerkzeuge zugänglich zu machen.</p>
         </projectDesc>
         <editorialDecl>
            <quotation>
               <p xml:lang="en">Quotation marks were left in the text and are not explicitly marked up.</p>
            </quotation>
            <hyphenation>
               <p xml:lang="en">Line breaks were removed and enhyphend words joined (except at page breaks) if they were composita and joined with "=" otherwise. Previously hyphenated words are not marked-up as such.</p>
            </hyphenation>
            <correction>
               <p xml:lang="en">After layout recognition with YOLO and text recognition with Transkribus, further correction was performed on the corpus as a whole:</p>
            </correction>
            <normalization>
               <p xml:lang="en">Spacing was normalized.</p>
            </normalization>
            <segmentation>
               <p xml:lang="en">Issues are split by page breaks. Within each page, paragraph boundaries are determined based on headings and byline elements, and paragraphs crossing a column were merged where possible.</p>
            </segmentation>
         </editorialDecl>
